    "culturalContext": {
      "references": [],
      "rationale": "Design rationale for The Night Market Coder:\nColor approach: warm palette reflecting hustle.\nTypography: expressive style for speed.\nDensity: maximalist to match their WeChat habits.\nKey influences: Chungking Express, city pop, night markets.\nA developer who grew up in East Asian night markets, now building tools for small merchants. They love the chaos, density, and humanity of crowded spaces."
    },
